{
  "notes": [
    "One entry per asset file or pack (SPEC §15.10). `path` is a glob relative to apps/fort-frenzy/ (`*` within a folder, `**` across folders); `font` names a Google Fonts family loaded by brand/head.html.",
    "licenses.test.ts fails if a file under art/ or audio/, or a font, has no entry, or its entry doesn't allow commercial use."
  ],
